    ["5231109   安全屋   单人位面"] = "5231109 Safe House Single-Player Instance",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【常在河边走】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>村庄里的无赖汉以碰瓷为生，故意摔倒后讹诈钱财，村民敢怒不敢言，这一次……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8，前往{Location:[拉姆德古堡(291,496)]|19247;39706;1424;2;5200130;0}处，与<Assistant_Red>托马斯</>对话接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度、冒险勋章、发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Walking by the River】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A scoundrel in the village makes a living by staging accidents to extort money. The villagers are angry but dare not speak out. This time...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the Advancement Quest, then advance to Sequence 8, go to {Location:[Lamud Castle(291,496)]|19247;39706;1424;2;5200130;0}, and speak with <Assistant_Red>Thomas</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoice Receipt",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【歌颂者时装】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>序列晋升奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得歌颂者时装套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过签到获取限时时装，后可通过<Assistant_System>序列晋升</>获取永久时装"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Bard Outfit】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Sequence Advancement Reward Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Bard Outfit set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtain limited-time outfit via check-in, then obtain permanent outfit via <Assistant_System>Sequence advancement</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【黑暗】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>默认展台场景\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Darkness】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand scene\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>一号信徒</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>冒险-团队副本\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>击杀普通难度一号信徒"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Believer Number One</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Adventure - Team Dungeon\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Defeat Believer Number One on Normal difficulty",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>破防提高<Mark>185</>，防御降低<Mark>15</>。使装备者获得威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>。\n<Mark>美德</>：武器<Mark>知识之乡</>会根据小队成员拥有的<Mark>美德</>额外提高攻击加成效果。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1,2, (Brand Expired)}</>Armor Break increased by <Mark>185</>, Defense decreased by <Mark>15</>. Grants the wearer the <Mark>Virtue</> of the Wetherell family.\n<Mark>Virtue</>: The weapon <Mark>Land of Knowledge</> will provide additional Attack bonuses based on the <Mark>Virtue</> possessed by team members.\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Iron and Blood Covenant</> set is active.",
    ["<InvDefault>1.因“非凡之路，感谢同行”福利计划，我们本周新增了【零元购凭证】的更多获取途径，修改内容如下：</>\n<InvDefault>【神降惊喜礼盒福利加码】</>\n<InvDefault>1）新增奖励内容：原秘宝箱子中获取的</><InvHighlight>神降惊喜礼盒稀有概率不变，新增了零元购凭证、多种金镑代金券奖励类型</><InvDefault>，且未获得稀有奖励时必定获得一定数量的绑定苏勒。</>\n<InvDefault>2）修改开启方式：</><InvHighlight>神降惊喜礼盒从默认自动开启修改为需手动确认开启</><InvDefault>。</>\n<InvDefault>3）我们将为符合情况的对应非凡者，发送本周已开启的神降惊喜礼盒对应数量的新增奖励礼盒，包括：概率获取的零元购凭证、多种金镑代金券和一定数量的绑定苏勒，之后将通过邮件形式发放，请非凡者关注后续邮件。</>\n<InvDefault>2.【剧情】</>\n<InvDefault>1）修复了特殊情况下，达到指定等级未正常开启主线任务的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>2）修复了现实主线《廷根守护者》中部分步骤黑屏时间过长的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>3）修复了特殊情况下现实主线《暗涌的危机》中无法找到伦纳德、弗莱的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>4）优化了部分主线动画的Skip节奏。</>\n<InvDefault>3.【副本】</>\n<InvDefault>1）下调了副本【黑荆棘事件簿·黄金之罪】中“洛克·金”骗局陷阱和债务之护机制处理失败后的技能伤害。</>\n<InvDefault>2）下调了副本【乌托邦剧院】困难和噩梦难度下，双人模式中怪物的伤害。</>\n<InvDefault>4.优化了【座驾】中车辆【留声机】的播放规则，若下车前已经暂停或者关闭留声机，再次上车会记录留声机状态，不会默认播放。</>\n<InvDefault>5.修复了【廷根】的【马车】和【骑警】的音效问题以及移动表现问题。</>\n<InvDefault>6.修复了特殊情况下，【原著瞬间】等【秩序世界】玩法物件消失无法交互，导致玩法无法完成的问题，非凡者可以回到原点位正常完成玩法。</>\n<InvDefault>7.修复了学徒技能【记录】和【漫游】在网络波动环境下触发异常的问题。</>"] = "<InvDefault>1. As part of the ‘Path of the Beyonder, Thank You for the Journey’ benefit program, more ways to obtain 【Zero-Cost Vouchers】 have been added this week, with the following changes:</>\n<InvDefault>【Divine Descent Surprise Gift Box Bonus】</>\n<InvDefault>1）New rewards: the original Treasure Chest's </><InvHighlight>rare-drop rate for Divine Descent Surprise Gift Boxes is unchanged, while Zero-Cost Vouchers and several pound-voucher reward types have been added</><InvDefault>. A quantity of bound soli is guaranteed whenever no rare reward is obtained.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Opening method changed: </><InvHighlight>Divine Descent Surprise Gift Boxes now require manual confirmation instead of opening automatically by default</><InvDefault>.</>\n<InvDefault>3）Eligible Beyonders will receive additional reward boxes matching the number of Divine Descent Surprise Gift Boxes opened this week. These may grant Zero-Cost Vouchers, several kinds of pound vouchers, and a quantity of bound soli. They will be delivered by mail; please watch for future messages.</>\n<InvDefault>2.【Story】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Fixed the main quest not starting normally upon reaching the required level under special circumstances.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Fixed excessively long black screens during some steps of the real-world main quest 《Guardian of Tingen》.</>\n<InvDefault>3）Fixed Leonard and Frye being impossible to find under special circumstances in the real-world main quest 《Undercurrent Crisis》.</>\n<InvDefault>4）Improved the Skip pacing of some main-story cinematics.</>\n<InvDefault>3.【Dungeons】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Reduced skill damage after failing the Locke King scam-trap and Debt Protection mechanics in 【Blackthorn Casebook · Sin of Gold】.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Reduced monster damage in two-player mode on Hard and Nightmare difficulties in 【Utopia Theatre】.</>\n<InvDefault>4. Improved the playback rules for the 【Gramophone】 vehicle feature under 【Mounts】. If the gramophone was paused or switched off before dismounting, its state is now remembered when mounting again instead of playback starting automatically.</>\n<InvDefault>5. Fixed sound and movement issues affecting 【Carriages】 and 【Mounted Police】 in 【Tingen】.</>\n<InvDefault>6. Fixed 【World of Order】 objects such as 【Original-Story Moments】 disappearing and becoming non-interactive under special circumstances, preventing completion. Beyonders can now return to the original location and finish normally.</>\n<InvDefault>7. Fixed abnormal triggering of the Apprentice skills 【Record】 and 【Wander】 during network instability.</>",
